{"unit_id":"7dgroup-ai__dsh-7d-tray-win#feature-1","repo":"7dgroup-ai/dsh-7d-tray-win","commit":"835c2ecc1228cd6ce7488fd11d9b0f39d3223e46","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 7D Tray Win 的功能「托盘菜单」：运行 DSH Web 时显示系统托盘图标，双击或选择菜单可打开 Web 界面、定位日志文件夹、确认后重启服务或停止服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["assets/tray-agent.ps1:69-117"]}
{"unit_id":"7dgroup-ai__dsh-7d-tray-win#feature-2","repo":"7dgroup-ai/dsh-7d-tray-win","commit":"835c2ecc1228cd6ce7488fd11d9b0f39d3223e46","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 7D Tray Win 的功能「生命周期同步」：托盘代理每 3 秒检查 DSH Web 父进程；进程结束后隐藏并移除托盘图标，插件卸载时也清理代理和实例记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["assets/tray-agent.ps1:119-134"]}
{"unit_id":"7dgroup-ai__dsh-7d-tray-win#feature-3","repo":"7dgroup-ai/dsh-7d-tray-win","commit":"835c2ecc1228cd6ce7488fd11d9b0f39d3223e46","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 7D Tray Win 的功能「静默桌面启动」：桌面快捷方式通过隐藏启动器启动 PowerShell，重放记录的 DSH 命令和环境，并在服务启动后打开对应 Web 地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["assets/starter.ps1:82-143"]}
